    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπρ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of dung, filthy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ κ.</span>
			<i>stinkard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				899
			</span></i>, with play on signf. <i><span class="en">
