			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Attica,
			of the deme <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κόπρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
